{
  "Name": "Samsung Security Manager 1.4 ActiveMQ Broker Service PUT Method Remote Code Execution",
  "Description": "This is an exploit against Samsung Security Manager that bypasses the patch in ZDI-15-156 & ZDI-16-481 by exploiting the vulnerability against the client-side. This exploit has been tested successfully using IE, FireFox and Chrome by abusing a GET request XSS to bypass CORS and reach the vulnerable PUT. Finally a traversal is used in the PUT request to upload the code just where we want it and gain RCE as SYSTEM.",
